{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "A Frog's Folly",
    "steam_appid": 3657470,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657470/extras/e69b4436c503d5eb9e7fabcaf95456fd.poster.avif?t=1755274272\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657470/extras/e69b4436c503d5eb9e7fabcaf95456fd.webm?t=1755274272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657470/extras/e69b4436c503d5eb9e7fabcaf95456fd.mp4?t=1755274272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Frog's Folly is a precise 2D platformer where your goal (as a cute lil frog) is to reach the stars! Can you master the movement to leap towards ascension, or will you fall down in folly?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Gameplay:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-stakes, physics-based platforming</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb to new heights! Try not to fall in folly</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use your tongue to launch yourself off walls and objects</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A simple concept that takes practice to master!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Maneuver through and around obstacles</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go where no frog has dared to go before!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Methodical platforming</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficult but addictive gameplay</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657470/extras/ad4d687ed5c2a56908114849e7ee58e3.avif?t=1755274272\" width=456 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's only one place to go and that's up! What lies beyond the slippery ascent? Do you have what it takes to reach for the stars? What lies above? What is drawing you to the sky? Uncover the mystery! Become the frog you were always meant to be!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Retro-Style Pixel Art <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657470/extras/575549afc6d3c2d9d63ddb402bd64cd4.avif?t=1755274272\" data-has-big width=800 height=320 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657470/extras/b64537a8b8ad423694a6cc34b07a150a.avif?t=1755274272\" width=602 height=490 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657470/extras/ca4b47f06cf7a193520f2c97959067ac.avif?t=1755274272\" width=800 height=456 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gorf<br>Made in Unity</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657470/extras/e69b4436c503d5eb9e7fabcaf95456fd.poster.avif?t=1755274272\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657470/extras/e69b4436c503d5eb9e7fabcaf95456fd.webm?t=1755274272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657470/extras/e69b4436c503d5eb9e7fabcaf95456fd.mp4?t=1755274272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Frog's Folly is a precise 2D platformer where your goal (as a cute lil frog) is to reach the stars! Can you master the movement to leap towards ascension, or will you fall down in folly?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Gameplay:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-stakes, physics-based platforming</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb to new heights! Try not to fall in folly</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use your tongue to launch yourself off walls and objects</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A simple concept that takes practice to master!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Maneuver through and around obstacles</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go where no frog has dared to go before!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Methodical platforming</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficult but addictive gameplay</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657470/extras/ad4d687ed5c2a56908114849e7ee58e3.avif?t=1755274272\" width=456 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's only one place to go and that's up! What lies beyond the slippery ascent? Do you have what it takes to reach for the stars? What lies above? What is drawing you to the sky? Uncover the mystery! Become the frog you were always meant to be!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Retro-Style Pixel Art <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657470/extras/575549afc6d3c2d9d63ddb402bd64cd4.avif?t=1755274272\" data-has-big width=800 height=320 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657470/extras/b64537a8b8ad423694a6cc34b07a150a.avif?t=1755274272\" width=602 height=490 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657470/extras/ca4b47f06cf7a193520f2c97959067ac.avif?t=1755274272\" width=800 height=456 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gorf<br>Made in Unity</p>",
